    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.2
  m_Text: '-Fixed bug with windows

    -New Textures

    -New graphics

    -Changed
    management, now it''s convenient

    -Cars travel by road

    -2 Secret

    -New
    walkthrough

    -Now there is an opportunity to explore part of the 2nd floor

    -Added
    red key

    -29 bugs fixed

    -Added cake

    -New beautiful garbage cans
    :)

    -A new interface created from scratch

    -Optimized for some devices

    -Changed
    the kitchen, as well as some elements of the house

    -Now the menu has a logo

    -Optimized
    for a ratio of 18:9

    -Added beautiful shaders

    -The neighbor''s windows
    can not be broken at the beginning

    And much more'
